<%# The trailer (Spec0031 §A9). Captions on by default (texttrack).

    With `autoplay: true` (the sales and offer page heroes), the player loads
    on page open, muted; Vimeo's own Unmute button turns the sound on. Without it (the home page's featured course),
    it's click to play: the poster and a play button render, and the Vimeo
    player loads only on click. Visitors who ask for reduced motion always
    get click to play. frontend/javascript/index.js does the loading.

    While there is no trailer, the course image stands in the video's place. %>
<% sales = page.sales %>
<% trailer_autoplay = (defined?(autoplay) && autoplay) ? true : false %>
<% if page.trailer_id %>
  <div class="sales-trailer" data-trailer data-vimeo-id="<%= page.trailer_id %>"<% if trailer_autoplay %> data-trailer-autoplay<% end %>>
    <button type="button" class="sales-trailer-play" aria-label="Play the trailer">
      <img src="<%= relative_url(sales.trailer.poster || sales.hero_image) %>" width="1280" height="720" alt="" />
      <span class="sales-trailer-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#9654;</span>
    </button>
  </div>
<% else %>
  <img class="sales-hero-image" src="<%= relative_url sales.hero_image %>" width="1280" height="720"
       alt="<%= sales.hero_image_alt %>" />
<% end %>
